# src architecture

Read root `AGENTS.md` for repository-wide placement, safety, and verification rules.

- Feature code in `src/modules/{marketing,storefront,vendor}`; shared cross-cutting in `src/shared/**`; wiring in `src/app/**`.
- Pages import services from `@/shared/api` only; never call Axios or `fetch` in pages/components.
- Shared wrappers: `@/shared/components`. Raw shadcn: `src/components/ui`. Class helper: `cn` from `@/lib/utils`.
- Prefer `@/` path alias. Function components only; Zustand for auth/cart.
- Fetch effects: include real dependencies, cancel or ignore stale work during cleanup, and surface
  failures with `getErrorMessage`.
- Run `npm run lint`; hook dependency and rules-of-hooks violations are errors.
- Non-hooks must not use the `use*` prefix (`isLiveApi`, not `useLiveApi`).
